<title>USA: Essex mulling operating, cash options.</title>
<headline>Essex mulling operating, cash options.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Essex Corp said Friday it is reviewing alternatives for rebalancing operations and cash available.</p>
<p>Essex said the alternatives include restructuring of operations, asset sales and outside financing.</p>
<p>The company today reported a 1996 fourth quarter loss of $1.3 million, or $0.36 a share.</p>
